# LoseControl$ EOT registers the lose-control command on EndOfTurn
# (ControlGainEffect.java:183-186), which PhaseHandler runs at the cleanup
# step (java:406). The Bears go back to the AI's battlefield, summoning sick
# again under the controller that regained them, and stay untapped: the
# Untap$ was real and nothing tapped them since.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 2 R
tapformana human 3 R
tapformana human 4 R
queue paygeneric R
queue paygeneric R
queue targets 5
castspell human 1
resolvestack
advance 9
